WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.479 --> 00:00:01.649
(whoosh)

00:00:01.649 --> 00:00:03.982
(soft boom)

00:00:16.173 --> 00:00:17.652
- [Evan] I believe in pink.

00:00:17.652 --> 00:00:20.436
I believe that laughing is
the best calorie burner.

00:00:20.436 --> 00:00:21.667
I believe in kissing.

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:22.820
Kissing a lot.

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:24.000
"I believe in being strong

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.125
"when everything seems to be going wrong.

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:28.612
"I believe that happy girls
are the prettiest girls.

00:00:28.612 --> 00:00:30.441
"I believe that tomorrow is another day

00:00:30.441 --> 00:00:32.647
"and I believe in miracles."

00:00:32.647 --> 00:00:33.854
Audrey Hepburn.

00:00:33.854 --> 00:00:36.658
One of the greatest screen
actresses of all time.

00:00:36.658 --> 00:00:38.071
If you want to achieve success,

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:39.685
start with what makes you happy.

00:00:39.685 --> 00:00:41.920
Before worrying about
what your one word is,

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:44.431
think about everything
that makes you happy.

00:00:44.431 --> 00:00:46.004
Start by making a list.

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:47.263
Just write what comes to mind

00:00:47.263 --> 00:00:49.986
and don't worry yet
about where it leads you.

00:00:49.986 --> 00:00:52.391
Get lost in happiness
as you make your list.

00:00:52.391 --> 00:00:54.813
Here are a few questions
to get you started.

00:00:54.813 --> 00:00:56.174
What's your favorite movie?

00:00:56.174 --> 00:00:57.405
What's your favorite book?

00:00:57.405 --> 00:00:58.746
What's your favorite song?

00:00:58.746 --> 00:01:00.481
Who is your best friend?

00:01:00.481 --> 00:01:02.879
What is your favorite quote to live by?

00:01:02.879 --> 00:01:05.491
What kind of people do
you like to hang out with?

00:01:05.491 --> 00:01:07.421
Who was your favorite boss?

00:01:07.421 --> 00:01:09.514
Why are you with your significant other?

00:01:09.514 --> 00:01:11.241
Who was your favorite teacher?

00:01:11.241 --> 00:01:14.390
What do you did you love
most about your parents?

00:01:14.390 --> 00:01:16.776
What activities make you come alive?

00:01:16.776 --> 00:01:19.455
What do you look forward
to most in your week?

00:01:19.455 --> 00:01:24.171
When was the last time you
felt overwhelmingly happy?

00:01:24.171 --> 00:01:27.483
These are all primers to get
you thinking and writing.

00:01:27.483 --> 00:01:28.449
Answer these questions

00:01:28.449 --> 00:01:32.107
and add whatever else comes
to mind that makes you happy.

00:01:32.107 --> 00:01:33.660
Fill the page with happiness

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:36.008
and feel the energy that comes from it.

00:01:36.008 --> 00:01:40.175
It could be the path to
your next million dollars.

00:01:57.959 --> 00:02:00.299
(whoosh)
(boom)

